tem-spacing\" data-source=\"loot\"><p style=\"text-align: center; color: green\"><b>Good</b></p><p style=\"text-align: center; margin: 0.4em 0 0.5em;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Star1\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"9\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Star1_fd1ea6.png\" width=\"10\"/></span><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Star1\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"9\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Star1_fd1ea6.png\" width=\"10\"/></span><br/><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Star1\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"9\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Star1_fd1ea6.png\" width=\"10\"/></span><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Star1\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"9\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Star1_fd1ea6.png\" width=\"10\"/></span></p></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Other Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"implemented\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"implementation-date\">10.80<br/>July 21, 2015<br/>Summer Update 2015</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\"><p>\t    See also: Hunting Places <span class=\"explained\">Help</span></p></nav>\n</aside>\n<p>The <b>Kha'zeel Dragon Lairs/Tiquanda</b> are two sets of dragon lairs much like the ones <a href=\"#/wiki/Kha%27zeel%20Dragon%20Lairs%2FKha%27labal\">accessed through Kha'labal</a>, but then accessed through <a href=\"#/wiki/Tiquanda\">Tiquanda</a> instead. The northern lairs can be accessed <a class=\"coord-link\" data-coord=\"33009,32604,7\" title=\"Ver no mapa\">here (33009, 32604, 7)</a>, and the southern ones <a class=\"coord-link\" data-coord=\"32983,32646,7\" title=\"Ver no mapa\">here (32983, 32646, 7)</a>.\n</p><p>The northern set of lairs consists of three lairs filled with 8 <a href=\"#/wiki/Dragon\">Dragons</a>, 4 <a href=\"#/wiki/Dragon%20Hatchling\">Dragon Hatchlings</a>, and 1 <a href=\"#/wiki/Dragon%20Lord\">Dragon Lord</a>.\n</p><p>The southern set of lairs consists of four lairs filled with 21 <a href=\"#/wiki/Dragon\">Dragons</a>, 9 <a href=\"#/wiki/Dragon%20Lord\">Dragon Lords</a>, 4 <a href=\"#/wiki/Dragon%20Hatchling\">Dragon Hatchlings</a>, and 2 <a href=\"#/wiki/Dragon%20Lord%20Hatchling\">Dragon Lord Hatchlings</a>.\n</p><p>Home of <a href=\"#/quest/the-great-dragon-hunt-quest\">The Great Dragon Hunt Quest</a>. The Kha'zeel Dragon Lairs/Tiquanda are also one of the spots you have to cartograph during the <a href=\"#/quest/cartography-101-quest\">Cartography 101 Quest</a>.\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Creatures_in_the_Northern_Lairs\">Creatures in the Northern Lairs</span></h2>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-First_Cave\">First Cave</span></h3>\n<p>There are 2 <a href=\"#/wiki/Dragon%20Hatchling\">Dragon Hatchlings</a> and 5 <a href=\"#/wiki/Dragon\">Dragons</a> in this cave.\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div><table cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"wikitable sortable full-width\"><tbody><tr><th>Name</th><th data-sort-type=\"number\" style=\"width: 38px; text-align: center;\">Exp</th><th data-sort-type=\"number\" style=\"text-align: center;\">HP</th><th data-sort-type=\"number\" style=\"text-align: center;\">Max. Damage</th><th style=\"font-size: small;\">Loot</th></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"width: 100px; text-align: center\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Dragon%20Hatchling\"><img alt=\"Dragon Hatchling\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"64\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Dragon_Hatchling_61f167.gif\" width=\"64\"/></a></span></span><br/><a href=\"#/wiki/Dragon%20Hatchling\">Dragon Hatchling</a></td><td style=\"width: 38px; text-align: center;\">185</td><td style=\"text-align: center;\">380</td><td style=\"text-align: center;\">200 (<span style=\"white-space: nowrap\">55 <span class=\"icon\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Physical%20Damage\"><img alt=\"Physical Damage\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"9\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Physical_Damage_Icon_356411.gif\" width=\"9\"/></a></span></span></span>, <span style=\"white-space: nowrap\">145 <span class=\"icon\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Fire%20Damage\"><img alt=\"Fire Damage\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"9\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Fire_Damage_Icon_7ba5fe.gif\" width=\"9\"/></a></span></span></span>)</td><td style=\"font-size: small;\"><div class=\"loot-table\" id=\"w-loot_perc_loot\">\n<ul><li>0-55× <a href=\"#/wiki/Gold%20Coin\">Gold Coin</a> (common)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Dragon%20Ham\">Dragon Ham</a> (common)</li>\n<li>Dragon's Tail (semi-rare)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Health%20Potion\">Health Potion</a> (very rare)</li>\n</ul>\n</div></td></tr><tr><td style=\"width: 100px; text-align: center\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Dragon\"><img alt=\"Dragon\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"64\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Dragon_24987b.gif\" width=\"64\"/></a></span></span><br/><a href=\"#/wiki/Dragon\">Dragon</a></td><td style=\"width: 38px; text-align: center;\">700</td><td style=\"text-align: center;\">1,000</td><td style=\"text-align: center;\">430 (<span style=\"white-space: nowrap\">120 <span class=\"icon\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Physical%20Damage\"><img alt=\"Physical Damage\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"9\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Physical_Damage_Icon_356411.gif\" width=\"9\"/></a></span></span></span>, <span style=\"white-space: nowrap\">310 <span class=\"icon\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Fire%20Damage\"><img alt=\"Fire Damage\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"9\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Fire_Damage_Icon_7ba5fe.gif\" width=\"9\"/></a></span></span></span>)</td><td style=\"font-size: small;\"><div class=\"loot-table\" id=\"w-loot_perc_loot\">\n<ul><li>1-105× <a href=\"#/wiki/Gold%20Coin\">Gold Coin</a> (common)</li>\n<li>1-3× <a href=\"#/wiki/Dragon%20Ham\">Dragon Ham</a> (common)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Steel%20Shield\">Steel Shield</a> (uncommon)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Crossbow\">Crossbow</a> (uncommon)</li>\n<li>Dragon's Tail (uncommon)</li>\n<li>1-10× <a href=\"#/wiki/Burst%20Arrow\">Burst Arrow</a> (uncommon)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Longsword\">Longsword</a> (semi-rare)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Steel%20Helmet\">Steel Helmet</a> (semi-rare)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Broadsword\">Broadsword</a> (semi-rare)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Plate%20Legs\">Plate Legs</a> (semi-rare)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Green%20Dragon%20Leather\">Green Dragon Leather</a> (rare)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Wand%20of%20Inferno\">Wand of Inferno</a> (rare)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Strong%20Health%20Potion\">Strong Health Potion</a> (rare)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Green%20Dragon%20Scale\">Green Dragon Scale</a> (rare)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Double%20Axe\">Double Axe</a> (rare)</li>\n<li>Dragon Hammer (rare)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Serpent%20Sword\">Serpent Sword</a> (rare)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Small%20Diamond\">Small Diamond</a> (very rare)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Dragon%20Shield\">Dragon Shield</a> (very rare)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Life%20Crystal\">Life Crystal</a> (very rare)</li>\n<li>Dragonbone Staff (very rare)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Dragon%20Trophy\">Dragon Trophy</a> (very rare)</li>\n</ul>\n</div></td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Second_Cave\">Second Cave</span></h3>\n<p>There is 1 <a href=\"#/wiki/Dragon\">Dragon</a> in this cave.\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div><table cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"wikitable sortable full-width\"><tbody><tr><th>Name</th><th data-sort-type=\"number\" style=\"width: 38px; text-align: center;\">Exp</th><th data-sort-type=\"number\" style=\"text-align: center;\">HP</th><th data-sort-type=\"number\" style=\"text-align: center;\">Max. Damage</th><th style=\"font-size: small;\">Loot</th></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"width: 100px; text-align: center\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Dragon\"><img alt=\"Dragon\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"64\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Dragon_24987b.gif\" width=\"64\"/></a></span></span><br/><a href=\"#/wiki/Dragon\">Dragon</a></td><td style=\"width: 38px; text-align: center;\">700</td><td style=\"text-align: center;\">1,000</td><td style=\"text-align: center;\">430 (<span style=\"white-space: nowrap\">120 <span class=\"icon\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Physical%20Damage\"><img alt=\"Physical Damage\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"9\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Physical_Damage_Icon_356411.gif\" width=\"9\"/></a></span></span></span>, <span style=\"white-space: nowrap\">310 <span class=\"icon\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Fire%20Damage\"><img alt=\"Fire Damage\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"9\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Fire_Damage_Icon_7ba5fe.gif\" width=\"9\"/></a></span></span></span>)</td><td style=\"font-size: small;\"><div class=\"loot-table\" id=\"w-loot_perc_loot\">\n<ul><li>1-105× <a href=\"#/wiki/Gold%20Coin\">Gold Coin</a> (common)</li>\n<li>1-3× <a href=\"#/wiki/Dragon%20Ham\">Dragon Ham</a> (common)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Steel%20Shield\">Steel Shield</a> (uncommon)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Crossbow\">Crossbow</a> (uncommon)</li>\n<li>Dragon's Tail (uncommon)</li>\n<li>1-10× <a href=\"#/wiki/Burst%20Arrow\">Burst Arrow</a> (uncommon)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Longsword\">Longsword</a> (semi-rare)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Steel%20Helmet\">Steel Helmet</a> (semi-rare)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Broadsword\">Broadsword</a> (semi-rare)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Plate%20Legs\">Plate Legs</a> (semi-rare)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Green%20Dragon%20Leather\">Green Dragon Leather</a> (rare)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Wand%20of%20Inferno\">Wand of Inferno</a> (rare)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Strong%20Health%20Potion\">Strong Health Potion</a> (rare)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Green%20Dragon%20Scale\">Green Dragon Scale</a> (rare)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Double%20Axe\">Double Axe</a> (rare)</li>\n<li>Dragon Hammer (rare)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Serpent%20Sword\">Serpent Sword</a> (rare)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Small%20Diamond\">Small Diamond</a> (very rare)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Dragon%20Shield\">Dragon Shield</a> (very rare)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Life%20Crystal\">Life Crystal</a> (very rare)</li>\n<li>Dragonbone Staff (very rare)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Dragon%20Trophy\">Dragon Trophy</a> (very rare)</li>\n</ul>\n</div></td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Third_Cave\">Third Cave</span></h3>\n<p>There are 2 <a href=\"#/wiki/Dragon%20Hatchling\">Dragon Hatchlings</a>, 3 <a href=\"#/wiki/Dragon\">Dragons</a>, and 1 <a href=\"#/wiki/Dragon%20Lord\">Dragon Lord</a> in this cave.\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div><table cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"wikitable sortable full-width\"><tbody><tr><th>Name</th><th data-sort-type=\"number\" style=\"width: 38px; text-align: center;\">Exp</th><th data-sort-type=\"number\" style=\"text-align: center;\">HP</th><th data-sort-type=\"number\" style=\"text-align: center;\">Max. Damage</th><th style=\"font-size: small;\">Loot</th></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"width: 100px; text-align: center\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=